  "notes": "{合併|がっぺい} refers to the merger or consolidation of organizations.\n\nWORD STRUCTURE:\n{合|がっ} (combine) + {併|ぺい} (merge) - to join together.\n\nVERB FORM:\n{合併|がっぺい}する: to merge\n{合併|がっぺい}される: to be merged\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {会社|かいしゃ}が{合併|がっぺい}する: companies merge\n- {市町村|しちょうそん}{合併|がっぺい}: municipal merger\n- {合併|がっぺい}{交渉|こうしょう}: merger negotiations\n- {合併|がっぺい}{後|ご}: after the merger\n- {合併|がっぺい}{比率|ひりつ}: merger ratio\n\nCONTEXTS:\n- Business: company mergers (M&A)\n- Government: municipal consolidation ({平成|へいせい}の{大|だい}{合併|がっぺい})\n\nRELATED:\n- {買収|ばいしゅう}: acquisition\n- {統合|とうごう}: integration",
